templates.en:
Part of the dataset has no active FEC in the ECU:
{0}

Without its FEC the gateway does not offer a profile to the head unit, and MKE does not work. The gateway has no command to switch FECs on: ContiTool writes them into the SWaP area of DataFlash through the RAM-Loader; the rest of DataFlash stays as it is.

templates.cn:
数据集的一部分在控制单元中没有激活的 FEC：
{0}

没有对应 FEC 时，网关不会向主机提供驾驶模式，MKE 也无法工作。网关没有打开 FEC 的命令：ContiTool 会通过 RAM 加载器把它们写入 DataFlash 的 SWaP 区域；其余 DataFlash 保持不变。
